        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"3ada14a5-5582-479a-8588-e237341acfb9\",\"review_text\":\"Best songs ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"977dd998-e1c2-4ef1-9a6d-a7921f854989\",\"review_text\":\"uninstall after update\"},{\"review_id\":\"a3f71d19-33ca-4d1d-836d-c4fe9c21baf8\",\"review_text\":\"More adds\"},{\"review_id\":\"b66b9d98-5911-4038-9656-4846557cc352\",\"review_text\":\"Whenever I go into Spotify and try to click on a song, it kicks me out? But I've been playing this one song on repeat and when I hit play down on thee screen U can play the music?\"},{\"review_id\":\"243b09d2-40c7-4437-a829-84c1b1af1f5b\",\"review_text\":\"Tum dhire dhire premium Karo humlog dhire dhire uninstall karenge😂\"},{\"review_id\":\"371366de-0556-4a3e-b019-1586af71d0d5\",\"review_text\":\"Me gusta mucho porque puedo encontrar miles de sonidos le doy 5 estrellas\"},{\"review_id\":\"2bfaaae5-aab2-49ba-8294-34bd5ccb5743\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely hate the new front page. Ugly, difficult, plays music out loud for no reason. Absolutely awful.\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc303192-344f-4641-b4b4-aa1cf85fd2f9\",\"review_text\":\"Just uninstall it\"},{\"review_id\":\"7b4f71d8-d91c-40bc-ae7e-b6124a25364a\",\"review_text\":\"I'm not buying premium so i use shuffle but Spotify keep repeat the same song\"},{\"review_id\":\"2fa0288a-ddc9-491b-83bb-1d33a4958eb6\",\"review_text\":\"Its good for the most and i use this app every day but keeps on playing over other apps when spotify 'was not suppost to be open' and it comes randomly and then skips songs at random. It also deleted a few of my favourite songs from a show i liked and i dont have premium so i dont get to listen to them ever again... with all of this though i still really like the app because of how easy it is to use and i love the karaoke feature,,, ads r a bit over the top tho\"}]}"
